WEBVTT

00:11:29.596 --> 00:11:31.716
which is what you've just
been listening to,

00:11:31.756 --> 00:11:35.796
thanks to the otherworldly talents
of my dear friend, Min Kym.

00:11:35.836 --> 00:11:42.676
(Applause)

00:11:44.916 --> 00:11:48.756
The Albinoni that day
was played by Vedran Smailović,

00:11:48.796 --> 00:11:51.236
the lead cellist of the Sarajevo Opera,

00:11:51.236 --> 00:11:54.716
in honor of 22 people
who had been killed the morning before,

00:11:54.756 --> 00:11:56.596
as they lined up for bread.

00:11:56.996 --> 00:12:00.556
Dressed in a formal white shirt
and black tails,